{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002_03_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:11b4b9560f8164cf8d157d8ca267133ba8fbdb93f1b10125650284748d96d9a7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e60d704e45c927e3902dabda9b3399edd96f67e7d95a568c051517ab9279904",
      "text": "刚才还对我大言不惭说什么“没有觉悟”，\n结果你自己一合格，就打退堂鼓要逃跑了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abd2a02f9e5275c77996249657978ac650e42d7401b7c2025cca5a62428974ce",
      "text": "……就是因为有觉悟，我才说不想和你们这群\n平庸之辈组队的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54d84d9f836f0a55df74243b2e4136ba335b83c4dd82d6b1285d5e9390d137c5",
      "text": "（哇啊，怎么办。\n这两个人火气越来越大了。得劝劝他们……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf060dc5f413e3a61bacd0097dc98888442e9bb6c8cbc82a7b5649d96cb6f275",
      "text": "薰先生，就算您打算再次参加试镜，\n要不要先参加我们这里的训练课程呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c5a8456039a301e5ede284954b1487814d5d7d39dd94f65ece3e62aa875658c",
      "text": "这是偶像事务所开设的专业课程。\n能高效提升行业内所需的各项技能哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c1c462b04a6cd434b53d7800f91cae888f8e0dd45896ac115b4646fec167c8d",
      "text": "……原来如此。有几分道理。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db3d236c2d9814b93bcffe4a4bb4976428bf7a4fd419686a8dfcea468555acb0",
      "text": "也好，课程我就去参加吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e161604530d802019adedba92a442c16b85ff7dfdfb27ce9487973d55000056e",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n那么贤君，请继续说明吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5d450e1ebb68bf5544a66328e04809bb5c30ce6f050d5adc77295c0692bc5a8",
      "text": "好的！\n那么，关于大家要参加的课程……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
